{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"da59f2354dbd7209","x":-480,"y":-267,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"[[Session Canvases.base]]\n#Session_Canvas"},
		{"id":"c6722cac5e165d1e","x":-520,"y":-180,"width":1325,"height":1250,"type":"text","text":"Last session Solaris Verdict began their journey to Armount, had a girls night, a boys night and a walk through Yormindar. While on the way to Yormindar you all saw an odd shape in the sky and also were hit by a arcane storm of lightening, during which one of you had the bright idea to become a lightening rod. You all then successfully made it to Yormindar and after talking with a few people including Balgus made your way to All-Hammers Will where you met the last living Yormindar. After seeing the ring on Saggnus's finger he asked why he should let him walk out alive and told him to prove himself and pick up the spear that he carries. So we pick up there both hands on the spear carried down through the Yormindar family for generations.\n\nDC 30 he gets the option to weaken his pact and begin to form a new one with Moradin. \n\nDC 25 He lifts the spear and can keep it, but cannot use it until breaking his pact. \n\nDC 20 he barely gets it off the ground and is free to leave. \n\nAnything below will result in a series of checks to persuade Burnavo not to kill him\n\n\nIts another 2 day travel to the spot where they can no longer use the sky ship then a 5 day hike up the mountain to Storm crest village.\n\n\nNight 1 in the snowy mountain range:\n\nStu\n\n\"You're vision wakes into a void of lightening raining down then a flash hits you and suddenly your standing on a frozen lake, with a waterfall covered in lightening in front of you and from deep within your soul you hear the voice of a woman \"Find the tomb know our history now your birth right\". \"\n\nNight 3 in the snowy mountain range:\n\nCassian Draemont\n\nI need everyone to leave the room.\n\n\"Your eyes open in a dark torch lit room with your father standing in front of you, \"Cassian we need to look for the artifact before he comes, if he finds us in here we are doomed to die. We need to find the change bringers staff remember the tome. At the bottom of Armount we will find a gate to a realm beyond. If we find the relic of the change bringer the master will bring fortune on us and it could lead us to the true goal the Relic of the one trapped in\" And the vision fades there\".\n\nNight 5 in the snowy Mountains: \n\nSaggnus WildBottom \n\n\"You awaken in a blaze of excruciating heat and see the familiar figure of Zariel holding a chain that is wrapped around your fathers neck. \"Knowing where you come from changes nothing. You are a servant and a slave, but you have been a bad dog and disobeying me so I command you. Collect an ancient tome within the Dunamis ward and give it to me, when you are nearing to the pain will guide the way. Remember this is you last chance disobey me again and you will suffer a fate far worse than death.\" Before you awake see a mirror and within it a red skinned man with horns, then you wake up with the symbol of a burning hand burned into your right shoulder \"\n\nWhile hiking each day roll a d8:\n\n\t1. A White Dragon can be spotted very close over head flying east.\n\t2. An avalanche hits and the party has to make skill checks to avoid falling down the cliff of a mountain top.\n\t3. Harsh snowy weather conditions rise and they lose a days travel.\n\t4. A nice snowy but clear day.\n\t5. A pack of Yetis can be seen blocking the parties pack (roll d12 for amount).\n\t6. An Ice storm begins and makes for rocky weather, they must make con saves beating a 15 or suffering 1 point of exhaustion.\n\t7. Can only happen once, the party sees the ghost of a woman crying that approaches Stu touching him on his chest showing him a vision of his mother fleeing Storm crest.\n\t8. A peaceful day.\n\nAs the party approach the village walls they will see many goliath warriors patrolling the grounds.\n\n\nOne named Argdin will be on the look at for Stu and an ally of Achilles he will have the letter from his mother and tell them basic information of what the state of the village is\n"}
	],
	"edges":[]
}